Congratulations, you've made it. As expected, you are our strongest warrior.
* [Who are you?]
- Frank, the one who left the message on the tablet for you, the leader of this spaceship. I was severely injured, so I also entered the cryo-pod to heal my wounds.
  Warrior, you’ve completed your mission. From here on, I will take control of the ship and prepare to meet with the Alliance Forces' ship.
* [The Alliance Forces? Why can’t I remember anything?]
- I’m afraid the injuries you sustained earlier caused permanent damage to your brain. I’m sorry, it was my failure that led to this accident. 
If you have any questions, I can answer them. ->questions

=== questions ===
* [What are the Alliance Forces?]
The Alliance Forces are a military organization formed by veterans of the old government. They have been the de facto rulers of the New Earth for over a decade.
On the other side, the Resistance emerged five years ago, and now both sides are fighting for control of the New Earth.
We are a scientific research team operating between the two, developing war weapons for both sides. The Alliance Forces are currently our employers. ->questions
* [What was the mission of this voyage?]
To deliver a new batch of weapons to the Alliance Forces. The weapon you’re holding is our latest research achievement. 
However, an accident occurred during the journey. Thanks to you, things didn’t turn into a complete disaster. ->questions
* [What happened on the ship?]
#cutscene
A Resistance spy infiltrated our team and sabotaged our fuel bay, intending to kill everyone on the ship. Fortunately, you turned the tide and eliminated him in a critical moment, but you were severely injured in the process.
The cryo-pod could heal your wounds, but it took a long time. By the time you woke up, all the other crew had already... ->questions

* ->question2

=== question2 ===
* [The person who collapsed near the tablet is...?]
- She was a new member of our team, someone with a promising future... I deeply regret her sacrifice.
* [But why was your tablet next to her...?]
* [The Resistance and their spy also lost contact, yet no one came...?]
- Wait a moment, the forces have arrived in orbit above the planet.
Don’t overthink it. Leave everything to me from here on, and you should return to the cryo-pod to rest.
(Frank turns around to operate the ship's console. Suddenly, You black out and fall to the ground.)
Ending 1 -- Mission Complete?
 ->END
